			]
			description: [
				"Coking coal gives off coal tar, and charring logs wood spirit, into a tank in the Furnace. Draw either off by pipe from any side, or with a bucket. The tank holds a bucket of one of them; past that, or while it holds the other, the rest burns away at the chimney."
				""
				"Coal tar is the start of almost every chemical in this book."
			]
			id: "670861ACF270D86D"
			rewards: [ ]
			subtitle: "What coking gives off"
			tasks: [
