		{
			dependencies: [
				"690A67A6D21199B1"
				"4718C7B7C98B7081"
			]
			description: [
				"Lab glass is eight pieces, each on an iron retort stand. Each takes its heat from what is under it, as a basin does, up to &6Hot&r: over &cSearing&r heat or hotter it cracks."
				""
				"Hot glass also cracks in rain or with water beside it, so a lab needs a roof. Cracked glass hisses and shatters five seconds later, spilling what it held."
			]
			id: "674C069C050D3746"
			rewards: [ ]
			subtitle: "Glassware on retort stands"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "061F41B748F4E622"
					item: "mcremix:round_flask"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			title: "Lab Glass"
			x: 1.75d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: [
				"674C069C050D3746"
			]
			description: [
				"A still is a round flask over heat, a still head with a thermometer, a coil condenser on its side arm and a cow receiver under the drip, with glass column pieces between flask and head when a mixture needs them."
				""
				"A bucket comes over cut by cut, lightest first, each into a fresh flask of the receiver, and what is left stays in the flask. The condenser needs water through it. Cuts that boil close together need column pieces to come over at full pace."
				""
				"&7JEI: the Distilling tab. Ponder: the still head.&r"
			]
			id: "3120A738668C125F"
			rewards: [ ]
			subtitle: "A bucket at a time, cut by cut"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "1659F024E6A6D5FF"
					item: "mcremix:still_head"
					type: "item"
				}
