			]
			description: [
				"Limestone or chalk fired at &cSearing&r burns to quicklime, giving off carbon dioxide, and washed quicklime is slaked lime. Slaked lime with soda ash and water mixes into caustic soda and chalk."
				""
				"Soda ash comes from kelp: fire it into kelp ash and wash that. Later, splitting salt water gives caustic soda by the bucket."
			]
			id: "2F5032893F65C980"
			rewards: [ ]
