		{
			dependencies: [
				"20B01B5CDC744C67"
				"3AC9A7994C4F9DC0"
			]
			description: [
				"Tanks standing on a whole layer of Create's andesite scaffolding form a vat, up to three wide and five high. A vat is closed, so it keeps gases a basin would lose, and it holds up to four fluids at once in layers."
				""
				"Left alone it settles and ferments. A mixer used on its side goes on as its vat form and stirs it, but only a mixer of the vat's own metal fits: a copper mixer for Create's copper tanks. Create's own mixer has no vat form."
				""
				"&7JEI: the Vat Mixing tab. Ponder: the copper mixer.&r"
			]
			id: "764E14D4DF0D32B5"
			rewards: [ ]
			subtitle: "Closed tanks on scaffolding"
